            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/0e700b59c4a0c1d216e071fd5ed6e34d.avif?t=1793828287\" width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Rainha Lich Valindra declarou guerra ao povo de Neverwinter e cabe a você e seus companheiros heróis rechaçar o exército das trevas. Crie seu próprio aventureiro e explore os Reinos Esquecidos como nunca antes. Visite locais clássicos de Dungeons &amp; Dragons, enfrente inimigos icônicos e descubra os muitos tesouros e segredos que essas terras guardam, seja solo ou com amigos. Comece sua aventura agora gratuitamente!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/c059faa39f5f93dc087901b558f34b3f.poster.avif?t=1793828287\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/c059faa39f5f93dc087901b558f34b3f.webm?t=1793828287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/c059faa39f5f93dc087901b558f34b3f.mp4?t=1793828287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Totalmente Gratuito para Jogar</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore e defenda Neverwinter, uma das cidades mais amadas dos Reinos Esquecidos de Dungeons &amp; Dragons, de forma totalmente gratuita!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/6d62a12244fa6f773a99f1fd10023cc7.poster.avif?t=1793828287\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/6d62a12244fa6f773a99f1fd10023cc7.webm?t=1793828287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/6d62a12244fa6f773a99f1fd10023cc7.mp4?t=1793828287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experiência Dungeons &amp; Dragons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seja você um jogador de RPG de mesa ou um leitor ávido dos livros, encontrará em Neverwinter os mesmos locais, classes e personagens icônicos que você já conhece do universo de Dungeons &amp; Dragons. Tudo o que você viveu nos dados ou nas páginas ganha vida em sua jornada por Faerûn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/14ffe1425543e9ecfbf4cf8096526a00.poster.avif?t=1793828287\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/14ffe1425543e9ecfbf4cf8096526a00.webm?t=1793828287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/14ffe1425543e9ecfbf4cf8096526a00.mp4?t=1793828287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combate de Ação Veloz</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mova-se de forma rápida e audaciosa nos confrontos para maximizar sua eficácia. Cada ataque, habilidade e esquiva exigirá planejamento, reflexos e execução precisa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/5aca595e6161e7a155f570ddd3ca0379.poster.avif?t=1793828287\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/5aca595e6161e7a155f570ddd3ca0379.webm?t=1793828287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/5aca595e6161e7a155f570ddd3ca0379.mp4?t=1793828287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/0e700b59c4a0c1d216e071fd5ed6e34d.avif?t=1793828287\" width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Rainha Lich Valindra declarou guerra ao povo de Neverwinter e cabe a você e seus companheiros heróis rechaçar o exército das trevas. Crie seu próprio aventureiro e explore os Reinos Esquecidos como nunca antes. Visite locais clássicos de Dungeons &amp; Dragons, enfrente inimigos icônicos e descubra os muitos tesouros e segredos que essas terras guardam, seja solo ou com amigos. Comece sua aventura agora gratuitamente!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/c059faa39f5f93dc087901b558f34b3f.poster.avif?t=1793828287\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/c059faa39f5f93dc087901b558f34b3f.webm?t=1793828287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/c059faa39f5f93dc087901b558f34b3f.mp4?t=1793828287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Totalmente Gratuito para Jogar</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore e defenda Neverwinter, uma das cidades mais amadas dos Reinos Esquecidos de Dungeons &amp; Dragons, de forma totalmente gratuita!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/109600/extras/6d62a12244fa6f773a99f1fd10023cc7.poster.avi